div.p:
“Viewing with concern the situation created by the attitude of the Govt of the
                    USSR and the Govts of Hungary, Bulgaria, Rumania and Albania, as well as the
                    Govts of Czechoslovakia and Poland, towards Yugo;

“Mindful of its authority to ‘recommend measures for the peaceful adjustment of
                    any situation regardless of origin, which it deems likely to impair the gen
                    welfare of friendly relations among nations’ (Art 14 of the UN Charter);

list.item:
“2. To normalize their diplomatic relations with Yugo and to
                                conform their diplomatic intercourse with the rules which are
                                customary in international relations;
